# Build products: derivable from the sources beside them, and excluded from the
# CosmicTera manifest for the same reason (BUILD_PRODUCTS in crypto/program.py).
*.json
*.fs
*.vvp
*.vcd

# program.hex is NOT here. It is a board artifact the manifest seals -- pattern
# `rtl/fpga/*/program.hex` in SYSTEM_PATTERNS -- and check_board_hex
# re-assembles it from the Makefile's PROGRAM to prove the hex on the board
# matches the source that produced it. A `make clean` once removed it from git
# and nothing noticed.
